{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an autonomous AI core, you wake up alone in a long-abandoned facility. With your memory missing, you set out upon a journey to discover who your are, your true nature, and the purpose for which you were created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set amidst a decaying near future where humanity appears to have been wiped out, you unravel a mystery that may allow humanity to thrive again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In your travels, you befriend an enthusiastic office assistant AI named LANDA, who helps to guide you on your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Core is a third-person adventure game with light puzzles and combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an autonomous core, you are a sphere that can roll through the world, taking advantage of pipes and rails to solve natural, environmental puzzles and quickly move long distances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress through the story by interacting with other characters and completing puzzles and objectives to clear the way through the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your zapper to open doors, move objects, activate switches and controls, and disable   enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete puzzles using mechanics such as moving platforms, fans, pressure plates, launchers, power switches, and more!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0The Core is developed by Electric Machine Games, a single developer in Virginia, USA.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3564330?t=1743192212","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/b751ee939f3dc4a9ce0efc2809b390fdc5320334/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743192212","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564330/fa468e113629beadfce39484068db27d8e27b6d8/capsule_23